Documentation content
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package ships no Esri-authored documentation. At run time, and only in
response to a request made by its user, the software retrieves pages and
files from Esri's public documentation hosts and public GitHub repositories
and returns them with a source line. That content remains the property of
Esri or its respective authors and is subject to their terms, including
Esri's terms of use (https://www.esri.com/en-us/legal/overview) and the
licence of each repository or package it comes from.

The product registry, the curated briefs under briefs/ and the test fixtures
under test/fixtures/synthetic are original works of this project. Files under
test/fixtures/oss are copies of Apache-2.0 licensed files from Esri's public
GitHub repositories; each directory there carries a provenance file naming
the source URL, commit and licence.

